OL,3,ACrazy Rich Asians to return as TV show
OL,4,Awith original film's stars
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's a 'Crazy Rich' family reunion!"
OL,7,Fsaid Adele Lim, who co-wrote the film,
OL,8,Fcalling it the sequel we've been
OL,9,Fwaiting for". It will "delve into the
OL,10,Fcharacters and worlds of Kevin Kwan's
OL,11,Fbrilliant books" over eight episodes,
OL,12,Fshe said.
OL,14,FThe show will be made by HBO, and the
OL,15,Fnews was announced days after HBO's
OL,16,Fparent company Warner Bros announced
OL,17,Fits #110bn (#82.8bn) merger with
OL,18,FParamount Skydance.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
